  displayName: Supply Planning
  description: Estimate ingredient use and set supply rates to support production.
  completionDialogue:
  - You planned ingredient supply around what production needs.
  - Keep stock available for the process without ordering far beyond expected use.
  isTutorial: 0
  minimumSystemEfficiencyPercent: 35
